{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>My soul is among lions</b> — on account of the assembly of Saul." "And the meaning of <i>lohatim</i> [the inflamed ones] — as though it were written: בתוך לוהטים." "And the meaning of both of them — those who speak evil against Saul on his account."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 57, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:04.753317571Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}